<view class="container"><view class="profile-head"><view class="avatar big-avatar">{{user.avatarText}}</view><view><view class="title">{{user.name}}</view><view class="muted">设计学院 · 大二 · 运动探索中</view></view></view><view class="stats card"><view><text class="metric">{{total}}</text><text class="metric-label">累计里程 / km</text></view><view><text class="metric">{{count}}</text><text class="metric-label">运动次数</text></view><view><text class="metric">{{streak}}</text><text class="metric-label">连续打卡 / 天</text></view></view><view class="section-title row between"><text>我的勋章</text><text class="muted small">{{unlockedCount}} / {{medals.length}} 已解锁</text></view><view class="medals card"><block wx:for="{{medals}}" wx:key="title"><view class="medal {{item.unlocked?'unlocked':''}}"><view class="medal-icon">{{item.icon}}</view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text class="muted tiny">{{item.desc}}</text></view></block></view><view class="row between section-title"><text>运动记录</text><text class="muted small" bindtap="openRecords">查看全部 ›</text></view><view class="section-title">本周运动目标</view><view class="goal-options card"><block wx:for="{{goalOptions}}" wx:key="*this"><view class="goal-option {{item===weeklyGoalKm?'selected':''}}" data-goal="{{item}}" bindtap="setGoal"><text>{{item}}</text><text class="goal-unit">km</text></view></block></view><view class="section-title">运动偏好</view><view class="card preferences"><view class="row between"><text>公开我的周榜排名</text><switch data-key="publicRank" checked="{{settings.publicRank}}" bindchange="changeSetting" color="#e36b3d" /></view><view class="row between"><text>允许好友看到打卡</text><switch data-key="shareCheckIn" checked="{{settings.shareCheckIn}}" bindchange="changeSetting" color="#e36b3d" /></view><view class="row between"><text>运动提醒</text><switch data-key="reminders" checked="{{settings.reminders}}" bindchange="changeSetting" color="#e36b3d" /></view><view class="preference-note muted">提醒开关仅保存本地偏好；当前原型不会发送订阅消息。</view></view><view class="section-title">开发者工具运营后台</view><view class="card local-admin-setting"><view class="row between"><text>连接本机 Web Admin</text><switch data-key="useLocalAdminBackend" checked="{{settings.useLocalAdminBackend}}" bindchange="changeSetting" color="#e36b3d" /></view><text class="muted small">只适用于同一台 Mac 的微信开发者工具模拟器；开启后同步本机挑战和公告配置，不上传个人运动记录。</text></view><button class="guide-btn" bindtap="openFeedback">意见反馈</button><button class="guide-btn" bindtap="showGuide">重新查看使用引导</button><button class="delete-btn" bindtap="clearRecords">删除本地运动记录</button><view class="privacy muted">数据仅用于校园运动服务。你可以随时停止记录、取消分享或删除运动数据。</view></view>
